docs {
  # Data-Stats-Member_Division

  Divisions are 0-based: 0 is Division 1, 10 is Rookie. See /data/constants/divisons for more information. Always for the authenticated member.

  ## Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Notes |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------|
  | event_type | number | yes | The event type code for the division type: 4 - Time Trial; 5 - Race |
  | season_id | number | yes |  |
}
